# Cross-platform line endings (root tooling config — owner A10, A0 hotfix on CI run 42824099611).
#
# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, so Prettier, ESLint, git diff and the
# CI format:check step behave identically on Windows, macOS and Linux. Without this, the
# Windows runner checks out CRLF (core.autocrlf=true) and `prettier --check` flags every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be text-normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.dmg binary
*.exe binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary

# The agent journal and build artefacts are local, never committed (also in .gitignore).
*.tmp.bak binary
